              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ, ame Yeova wa nguthu, ũla ũtataa ala alũngalu, ũla wonaa ngoo na kĩlilikano, none ũĩvanĩsya waku kwoo; nũndũ nĩnakwonisye ũvoo wakwa. ",
